\v 9 “You¦375695 \add ≈expected¦375695\add* much¦375698, but¦375699 \add gained\add* little¦375700. Anything you¦375701 brought¦375701 home¦375702, I¦375703 blew¦375703 away \add again\add*. Why? Commander-in-chief Yahweh¦375708 \add ≈says¦375707\add* it's because¦375710 my¦375711 residence is¦375715 still in ruins¦375715, while you're¦375716 all \add busy\add* \add ≈working on\add* \add %your¦375719\add* own¦375719 houses¦375719.
