\v 14 “\add ≈That's what Yahweh¦376139 declares¦376137 about you\add* people¦376129,” Haggay¦376126 \add ≈continued¦376127\add*. “\add He says that\add* \add ≈that's how this¦376131 country¦376134 acts towards him\add*. \add ≈Your actions¦376143 are dishonourable, and¦376145 then that¦376145 same disrespect transfers to your offerings\add*.
